  "description": "Horizontal natural gas jet fire from the DNV GL (2008) programme, as tabulated in the full dataset at the end of Miller (2017). Pure methane (C1 = 1), 5 m/s wind at 10 m. Flame length only: the source tabulates the centreline length but no radiometer readings, so this bench checks the correlation and nothing downstream of it. These three sit inside the 0.1-32 kg/s release range this project targets.",
